OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells. There
OL,7,Fwill be a few passing showers but some
OL,8,Fa fair amount of dry weather too.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FAny showers will die out this
OL,11,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,12,Fwill be dry with clear periods.
OL,13,FFreshening southerly winds along the
OL,14,Feast coast later.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,17,Fheavy, will spread northeast during
OL,18,Fthe morning. Drier and brighter
OL,19,Fweather will spread from the west in
OL,20,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
