OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith some sunshine on Monday. Windy on
OL,7,FTuesday with rain spreading northeast
OL,8,Fon Tuesday. Sunny intervals and a few
OL,9,Fshowers on Wednesday.
